menu "S3Wear core (sys_core)"

    config S3W_EDITION_PRO
        bool "S3Wear Pro edition"
        default y
        help
            Pro edition (docs/10-editions-licensing.md §3): phone services, notifications,
            health beyond steps, voice, the store, Wi-Fi and the other Pro-only features.
            Off builds the Community edition (sdkconfig.defaults.community): those features
            are not compiled, and their launcher entries, tiles and settings are hidden.
            Code tests the flag through s3w_edition.h (S3W_EDITION_PRO), which the
            simulator and host tests set without sdkconfig.h.

    config S3W_LVGL_THREAD_CHECK
        bool "Assert on LVGL access without lv_lock()"
        default y
        help
            Debug aid: the LVGL port aborts with a backtrace when an LVGL object is
            invalidated or LVGL memory is allocated by a task that does not hold
            lv_lock() (the UI task always does). Off in release builds.

endmenu
